OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-16 sexual communication
OL,4,Acharge for former PC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ex-police officer has been charged
OL,7,Fwith sexual communication with a girl
OL,8,Faged under 16.
OL,10,FFormer PC Ryan Stubbs, aged 27, will
OL,11,Fappear at Luton Magistrates' Court on
OL,12,F10 September, Thames Valley Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FThe offences are alleged to have taken
OL,16,Fplace between April and May 2025.
OL,18,FThe force said Stubbs, who was
OL,19,Fpreviously based at Cowley Police
OL,20,FStation, was no longer serving and had
OL,21,Fresigned in August 2025.
